.TH xml_find_element 3
.SH NAME
xml_find_element \- find an element by tag name
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "xml.h"
.PP
.BI "xmlnode *xml_find_element(xmlnode *" node ", const char *" tag ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xml_find_element
searches for an element node matching the specified
.I tag
name. It returns the first matching node in the tree, or NULL.